 "c": [
  {"i":2704,"t":["food","drink"],"s":{"3":["communication"]},"n":"Mouthful/bite is eating and sip/gulp is drinking. It is not a true counter, so drop measures. The share sense is rare at this level."},
  {"i":2729,"t":["qualities","character"],"s":{},"n":"Beauty describes scenery and things as much as people's looks, so qualities comes first and character second."},
  {"i":2747,"t":["actions","function"],"s":{},"n":"Humble giving verb taught with あげる/もらう, and also the auxiliary 〜て差し上げる. It is not a greeting set phrase."},
  {"i":2758,"t":["technology"],"s":{"2":["feelings"]},"n":"The machine-setting sense is technology and the frame-of-mind sense is feelings. Qualities is a loose fit."},
  {"i":2767,"t":["transport"],"s":{"1":["technology"]},"n":"Driving is the core learner sense and machine operation is technology. The fund-management sense is rare for learners."},
  {"i":2797,"t":["position"],"s":{"2":["language"],"4":["nature","science"]},"n":"Space/room is about where things go, so qualities does not fit. The text-spacing sense is language and outer space is nature/science."},
  {"i":2810,"t":["function","greetings"],"s":{},"n":"First taught as a keigo grammar pattern. Its use in polite set phrases comes second."},
  {"i":2817,"t":["business"],"s":{},"n":"Taught mainly as a business/economy loanword. The safety association is too loose for a law unit."},
  {"i":2819,"t":["drink","food","sports"],"s":{},"n":"Drinking vessel first, then the measuring cup in cooking, then the trophy sense (ワールドカップ). It has only one sense, so no sense entry is needed."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":2704,"keep":[],"n":"一口に言えば 'in short' is an idiom, not taught in a communication unit; sense 4 is rare"},
  {"i":2707,"keep":[],"n":"センチ for 'sentimental' is dated slang and rare for learners"},
  {"i":2713,"keep":[],"n":"Tracing a criminal's movements is a news-register extension, rare at this level"},
  {"i":2716,"keep":[],"n":"Timer or recording 予約 extends the booking sense and is taught with reservations, not technology"},
  {"i":2730,"keep":[],"n":"Figurative 'switching over' is an extension of the switch sense; not an actions-unit word"},
  {"i":2742,"keep":[],"n":"Insiders or members of a group is a less common extension; the family sense dominates"},
  {"i":2745,"keep":[],"n":"座 as 'the gathering or atmosphere' (座を盛り上げる) is idiomatic and advanced"},
  {"i":2748,"keep":[2],"n":"テストの出来 'how well one did' is common and fits the school unit"},
  {"i":2749,"keep":[4],"n":"仕込み/仕込む prepping ingredients is a common real-world kitchen and restaurant sense"},
  {"i":2750,"keep":[1],"n":"Literal front-facing (前向きに座る) is common and fits position"},
  {"i":2751,"keep":[2,3],"n":"Race time and calling a time-out are both common sports senses"},
  {"i":2758,"keep":[],"n":"仕事モード is casual and describes a state rather than an emotion; not a feelings-unit word"},
  {"i":2761,"keep":[],"n":"Marking a player and posting a record are specialised sports and news jargon for this level"},
  {"i":2765,"keep":[2],"n":"喫茶店・バーのマスター is a very common everyday sense; it fits jobs and the café/restaurant setting"},
  {"i":2767,"keep":[1],"n":"Machine operation (エアコンの運転, 運転中) is common and fits technology"},
  {"i":2771,"keep":[],"n":"たいてい meaning 'probably' is uncommon; the usually/most senses dominate"},
  {"i":2774,"keep":[],"n":"畜生 as 'beast' is archaic or Buddhist; learners meet only the curse"},
  {"i":2775,"keep":[],"n":"夜を明かす is a set phrase and not taught in the time unit"},
  {"i":2786,"keep":[],"n":"The 'uneasy' sense is rare; the unreliable/helpless senses fit character"},
  {"i":2794,"keep":[3],"n":"Device or software behaviour (動作が遅い, 動作確認) is very common and fits technology"},
  {"i":2797,"keep":[2],"n":"スペース between words (スペースキー, スペースを入れる) is common in writing and typing; outer space is normally 宇宙"},
  {"i":2814,"keep":[4],"n":"The 'forbidden' sense is how learners meet 無用 on signs and notices; it fits law"},
  {"i":2832,"keep":[2,6],"n":"判決を下す (law) and お腹を下す (health) are common; lowering is usually 下ろす, and 'defeat' is headline register"},
  {"i":2837,"keep":[4],"n":"Game stages and levels are common and fit hobbies; 'phase' is not a time-unit word"}
 ]
